{"data":{"id":9571,"title":"Bài Tập 3: Xây dựng Config Server quản lý cấu hình tập trung cho các Microservice","description":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bài Tập 3: Xây dựng Config Server quản lý cấu hình tập trung cho các Microservice</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><i><span style=\"font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cấp độ: Vận dụng chuyên sâu | Tổng hợp kiến thức Session 02 &amp; 03</span></i></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:14pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>1. Mục tiêu kiến thức</strong></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hiểu vấn đề quản lý cấu hình khi có nhiều Microservice và lý do cần Config Server.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Xây dựng Spring Cloud Config Server sử dụng native profile (file cấu hình nằm trong resources).</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cấu hình các Microservice làm Config Client, lấy cấu hình từ Config Server khi khởi động.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thực hành kết nối cấu hình database MySQL thông qua Config Server.</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:14pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>2. Tình huống nghiệp vụ</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tiếp nối từ Bài tập 2, hệ thống MediCare đã có 5 Microservice chạy độc lập. Tuy nhiên, mỗi service đang tự quản lý file application.yml riêng. Khi cần thay đổi thông tin kết nối database (ví dụ: đổi password MySQL, đổi URL database khi chuyển server), lập trình viên phải mở từng dự án ra sửa, build lại rồi deploy lại từng service — rất tốn thời gian và dễ sai sót.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Giải pháp: Tạo một dự án Config Server đóng vai trò là \"kho cấu hình tập trung\". Tất cả các Microservice khi khởi động sẽ gọi tới Config Server để lấy cấu hình thay vì đọc từ file application.yml cục bộ.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:14pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>3. Yêu cầu của bài tập</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Yêu cầu 1 — Tạo dự án Config Server (port 8888):</strong></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tạo dự án Spring Boot mới: config-server.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thêm dependency spring-cloud-config-server trong build.gradle.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thêm annotation @EnableConfigServer vào main class.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sử dụng native profile: tạo thư mục config-repo bên trong src/main/resources/.</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Yêu cầu 2 — Tạo file cấu hình cho từng service trong config-repo/:</strong></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bên trong thư mục src/main/resources/config-repo/, tạo các file cấu hình:</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">patient-service.yml</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">doctor-service.yml</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">appointment-service.yml</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">medical-record-service.yml</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">pharmacy-service.yml</span></span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Yêu cầu 3 — Cấu hình các Microservice làm Config Client:</strong></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thêm dependency spring-cloud-starter-config vào build.gradle của từng Microservice.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Xóa toàn bộ cấu hình database, port trong file application.yml cục bộ của từng service.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thay thế bằng cấu hình trỏ tới Config Server:</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Yêu cầu 4 — Kiểm thử:</strong></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Khởi động Config Server trước (port 8888).</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Truy cập http://localhost:8888/patient-service/default trên trình duyệt để xác nhận Config Server trả về đúng cấu hình.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Khởi động từng Microservice, xác nhận chúng lấy cấu hình từ Config Server (xem log khi khởi động).</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Test lại các API CRUD trên Postman để đảm bảo mọi thứ vẫn hoạt động bình thường sau khi chuyển sang Config Server.</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:14pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>4. Kết quả mong muốn</strong></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Config Server chạy trên port 8888, trả về đúng cấu hình khi truy cập /patient-service/default, /doctor-service/default, ...</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">5 Microservice khởi động thành công, lấy cấu hình database từ Config Server (không còn cấu hình database trong file application.yml cục bộ).</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tất cả API CRUD vẫn hoạt động đúng trên Postman như Bài tập 2.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cấu trúc thư mục config-repo/ gọn gàng, mỗi file đặt tên đúng theo spring.application.name.</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:14pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>5. Hướng dẫn nộp bài</strong></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:4